sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Usuario
  participant FE as Next.js
  participant FA as Firebase Auth
  participant API as API ASP.NET Core
  participant W as Wompi
  participant YA as YAuctions
  participant DB as SQL Server
  U->>FE: Busca y confirma carrito
  FE->>FA: Sesion / ID token
  FE->>API: POST /orders/checkout + token
  API->>DB: Orden PendingPayment
  API->>W: Crear transaccion
  W-->>FE: Checkout / widget
  U->>W: Paga
  W->>API: Webhook Approved firmado
  API->>DB: Pago Approved / Orden Paid
  API->>YA: Ejecutar compra
  YA-->>API: Exito / Rechazo
  API->>DB: Completed o Compensation
  API-->>FE: Historial y estado
